<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ site.domain }}</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body {
    margin: 0; min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font: 15px/1.6 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    background: #f6f7f9; color: #1a1d21;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    body { background: #14161a; color: #e6e8eb; }
    .card { background: #1c1f24 !important; border-color: #2c3037 !important; }
    code { background: #14161a !important; }
  }
  .card {
    background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e5ea; border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 32px 36px; max-width: 460px;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  p { margin: 0 0 12px; color: #6b7280; }
  code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 13px; background: #f6f7f9; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>{{ site.domain }} is ready</h1>
    <p>This site was created by lite-panel and is serving from:</p>
    <p><code>{{ site.webroot }}</code></p>
    <p>Upload your files there — over FTP, or through the panel's file
       manager — and replace this page.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
